 </span><span begin="00:38.140" end="00:40.630">smile </span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:40.630">（</span><span begin="00:40.630" end="00:40.990">may </span><span begin="00:40.990" end="00:41.500">your </span><span begin="00:41.500" end="00:43.510">smile</span><span begin="00:43.510" end="00:43.540">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.540" end="00:49.630"><span begin="00:43.540" end="00:44.770">Shine </span><span begin="00:44.770" end="00:47.140">on </span><span begin="00:47.140" end="00:47.140">（</span><span begin="00:47.140" end="00:49.570">shine </span><span begin="00:49.570" end="00:49.630">on</span><span begin="00:49.630" end="00:49.630">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.630" end="00:55.930"><span begin="00:49.630" end="00:50.417">Don't </span><span begin="00:50.417" end="00:51.204">be </span><span begin="00:51.204" end="00:51.991">scared </span><span begin="00:51.991" end="00:52.778">（</span><span begin="00:52.778" end="00:53.565">don't </span><span begin="00:53.565" end="00:54.352">be </span><span begin="00:54.352" end="00:55.139">scared</span><span begin="00:55.139" end="00:55.930">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.930" end="01:01.420"><span begin="00:55.930" end="00:56.140">Your </span><span begin="00:56.140" end="00:57.340">destiny </span><span begin="00:57.340" end="00:57.730">may </span><span begin="00:57.730" end="00:58.240">keep </span><span begin="00:58.240" end="00:59.020">you </span><span begin="00:59.020" end="01:01.420">warm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.200" end="01:08.530"><span begin="01:02.200" end="01:02.740">Cos </span><span begin="01:02.740" end="01:03.160">all </span><span begin="01:03.160" end="01:03.460">of </span><span begin="01:03.460" end="01:03.700">the </span><span begin="01:03.700" end="01:05.410">stars </span><span begin="01:05.410" end="01:05.710">are </span><span begin="01:05.710" end="01:06.730">fading </span><span begin="01:06.730" end="01:08.530">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="0